@startuml trace-validation
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
title Checking real start-ups against the model (ledger S8)

rectangle "tests/storage_trace.rs" as Harness #DDEBF7 {
  component "a case: a profile,\ncrashes and power cuts" as Case #DDEBF7
  component "start-up, in main.rs's order\n(begin, migrate, prepare,\nreconcile, finish)" as Startup #DDEBF7
}

rectangle "gaze-fs" as Fs #E2EFDA {
  component "TraceFs\n(records each operation)" as Trace #E2EFDA
  component "MemFs\n(A1–A3, or W1–W2:\npending operations, power cuts)" as Mem #E2EFDA
}

component "migrate/trace.rs\n(names and operations\ninto the model's terms)" as Convert #DDEBF7
file "Trace_<case>.tla\nTrace_<case>.cfg" as Module #FFF2CC
component "TLC\n(ProfileStartupTrace.tla\nover ProfileStartup.tla)" as Tlc #E2EFDA

card "**accepted**: TraceEnd violated,\nevery event matched" as Accepted #FCE4D6
card "**rejected**: the model cannot\nfollow; the first event it\ncannot match is named" as Rejected #F8CBAD

Case --> Startup : each restart\nis a new process
Startup --> Trace : every file operation
Trace --> Mem : forwarded
Case --> Mem : crashes,\npower cuts
Trace ..> Convert : the operations, in order
Mem ..> Convert : the pending queue\nat each power cut
Convert --> Module
Module --> Tlc
Tlc --> Accepted
Tlc --> Rejected

note bottom of Rejected
  Two mutant traces must be rejected:
  a move without its folder sync, and
  a move whose link and unlink are swapped.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  |<#DDEBF7> | F1R3Gaze code and tests |
  |<#E2EFDA> | the test file systems, and TLC |
  |<#FFF2CC> | a generated file |
  |<#FCE4D6> | the verdict a trace must get |
  |<#F8CBAD> | a rejection |
endlegend
@enduml
